{"id":"n28986-1-7","stage":4,"title":"진료 · 诊疗","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28986-1-7-1","ko":"의사 선생님께서는 토요일에도 진료를 하시나요?","zh":"医生先生周六也会出诊吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"의사","meaning":"医生","explanation":"의사：医生","readings":[{"term":"의사","audio":"/audio/9b6834dbb2bfc221d4ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20256","senseId":"1","lemma":"의사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선생님께서는","meaning":"先生","explanation":"선생님：先生；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"2","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"토요일에도","meaning":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","explanation":"토요일：星期六，周六，礼拜六；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"토요일","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30214","senseId":"1","lemma":"토요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"진료를","meaning":"诊疗，诊治","explanation":"진료：诊疗，诊治；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"진료","audio":"/audio/16fab363f8f2f4d9e376.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28986","senseId":"1","lemma":"진료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하시나요?","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9b6834dbb2bfc221","term":"의사","zh":"医生","audio":"/audio/9b6834dbb2bfc221d4ef.mp3","entryId":"20256","definition":"具有一定资格、以诊断治疗病症为业的人。","pronunciation":["의사"]},{"id":"daac5ca7b302bd9b","term":"선생님","zh":"先生","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3","entryId":"62818","definition":"加在某人的姓氏或职业之后，以表示对其的尊敬。","pronunciation":["선생님"]},{"id":"9f4eef79554b65d0","term":"토요일","zh":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3","entryId":"30214","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第六天。","pronunciation":["토요일"]},{"id":"16fab363f8f2f4d9","term":"진료","zh":"诊疗，诊治","audio":"/audio/16fab363f8f2f4d9e376.mp3","entryId":"28986","definition":"指医生诊断治疗患者。","pronunciation":["질ː료"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/df31e4a742eaceeabe8f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28986-1-7-2","ko":"네, 그런데 토요일에는 오전 중에 진료가 끝나요.","zh":"是的，不过周六的诊程会在上午就结束。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런데","meaning":"可是，可","explanation":"그런데：可是，可","readings":[{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70717","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"토요일에는","meaning":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","explanation":"토요일：星期六，周六，礼拜六；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"토요일","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30214","senseId":"1","lemma":"토요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오전","meaning":"上午","explanation":"오전：上午","readings":[{"term":"오전","audio":"/audio/1087feb238ccd11091f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20246","senseId":"1","lemma":"오전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중에","meaning":"的时候","explanation":"중：的时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"2","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"진료가","meaning":"诊疗，诊治","explanation":"진료：诊疗，诊治；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"진료","audio":"/audio/16fab363f8f2f4d9e376.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28986","senseId":"1","lemma":"진료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝나요.","meanin